  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rberedande insats Skattereform II Moldavien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inception phase Tax Reform II Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till att finansiera framtagandet av ett v&#xe4;l genomarbetat programf&#xf6;rslag f&#xf6;r en andra fas av samarbetet (twinning) mellan det svenska skatteverket och den moldaviska skattemyndigheten i att reformera skattesystemet i landet.

Skatteverket inkom i september 2017 med ett utkast till projektf&#xf6;rslag. Efter gransking av ambassaden och dess kvalitetss&#xe4;kringskommitt&#xe9; ombads Skatteverket att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kvalit&#xe9;n p&#xe5; f&#xf6;rslaget (se bilaga 3 &#x2019;Notes from QAC&#x2019; och 4 &#x2019;Letter to Skatteverket with recommendations of amendments&#x2019;). Efter en rad f&#xf6;rhandlingar s&#xe5; bed&#xf6;mde ambassaden och Skatteverket att den b&#xe4;sta l&#xf6;sningen var att f&#xf6;rst genomf&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rberedande fas d&#xe4;r Skatteverket tillsammans med sin Moldaviska partner tar fram ett v&#xe4;l genomarbetat f&#xf6;rslag till programmet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the contribution is to finance the preparation of good quality programme proposal for a second phase of the collaboration (twinning) between the Swedish Tax Agency and the Moldovan Tax Service to reform the taxation system in the country.

In September 2017, the Swedish Tax Agency (STA) submitted a draft project proposal. The Embassy and its Quality Assurance Committee reviewed the proposal and recommended a set of amendments (Se Annex 3 &#x2018;Notes from QAC&#x2019; and 4 &#x2018;&#x2019;Letter to Skatteverket with recommendations of amendments&#x2019;). Following a series of negotiation it was agreed jointly by the Embassy and the STA to first implement an inception phase through which the STA together with its Moldovan counterpart should prepare a good quality proposal for the implementation of the programme.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Inception phase was to conduct preparatory work and missions to Moldova, in order to complete the proposal for a second phase of the collaboration between the Swedish Tax Agency and the Moldovan State Tax Service.</narrative>
  </description>
